# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Research archive: binaries excluded
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# research/legacy-site-capture-2026-09-25/ holds a full capture of the
# PREVIOUS plexusdevelopmentgroup.ca site. The written evidence and the capture
# scripts are versioned, because every unverified claim on the current site is
# traced back to them.
#
# The captured binaries are not. They are third-party media (a Pexels film,
# Unsplash stock photography, the municipality's planning PDF) whose
# redistribution rights have not been confirmed, and they add ~105 MB to a
# repository that otherwise contains one website. They are reproducible with
# the capture scripts in the same folder.
research/legacy-site-capture-2026-09-25/assets/
